russian/polish I can not be 100% sure it is grammaticaly correct, let me know if something is off about the translation. I am looking to see if I can change the language of the tutorial parchment. Some minor changes also have been updated!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:07:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925767","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1844751498232421","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 2.6","summary":"Hello Shadow Dancers, A small patch for the demo: Fixed a bug where the 1.5sec shield talent alone wouldnt work, it can now.Removed the 1meter extra radius talent, was not fun and not as good as the othersReplaced the talent with: When Umbral Wake is activated, it refresh your dash cooldown! I believe it will be way more fun and new build can be done! Added an effect when you use the +40% move speed talent when swappingMade the main Character more dynamicWorking on making the talent readable for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T19:59:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232421","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1844115010494306","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"announcement","title":"Speedrun/Hardcore mode is live!","summary":"Demo Update 2.5:An Hardcore, Speedrun and Normal mode have been added upon starting a new game!Hardcore: die once, you restart from the begenning! No talent reset and no difficulty choices! (your game will save as normal)Speedrun (local for now): Play like Normal but without talent reset, no difficulty choices and with a timer! (no saves allowed). All the time are just local but will be worldwide for the full game (maybe later for the demo)Normal: You can reset your talent as much as you want! A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T10:01:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494306","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1843481262700015","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"announcement","title":"Beat me at my own game!!","summary":"SWIPSWAP CHALLENGE: WIN YOUR GAME KEY! Want to test your reflexes and grab the full game for free at launch? It's time to prove what you're worth on the SwipSwap demo! The Challenge:Be one of the first 5 to finish the demo in under 6 minutes (my personnal best) to score a free game key (1 key max per person). Don't sleep on it, it will last until November 2nd 2026! Also, the first person to beat the demo with the \"Hardcore mode\" will get a key! (You can not cumulate with the Speedrun key) The Ti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T18:51:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700015","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1842846814444632","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 2.0","summary":"Hello Shadow Dancers, I am pleased to announce the Demo 2.0 is out with a loooooot of changes:Level up systemsNew talentsNew spellNew Main Menu screenAmazing game feel addedNew Tutorial areaNew Capsule ArtRedesign of the first room with added new boss mecanic Removed 2D static wall of fire for a brand new oneNew HUDRedisign of the 2nd roomNew HP bar for bossesAnd I probably forgot some..I am working on:Making a Hardcore and SpeedRun modeStill have to continue working on those next roomsI Hope yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T21:06:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444632","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1839041357033828","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"announcement","title":"News","summary":"Shadow Dancers!I know I said I wouldn't do any updates until the October NextFest, but I wanted to share what I am currently working on:A brand new spell for you to use.New Talents (12 in total!).A new progression system: I want players to feel rewarded for killing mobs and bosses even if they get hit. I'm adding an EXP system where leveling up lets you choose a talent. EXP is kept upon death, so no run feels completely wasted.Note: Even if you reach max level and unlock all talents, you'll defi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T14:01:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033828","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1838407329262408","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"update","title":"First Demo Update","summary":"Hello Shadow Dancers!I am pleased to announce a demo update. Here is a list of what has changed:Options added to the main menu: You can now access settings in both the pause and main menus.New Options:Voice Slider: You can finally mute Dracoulous while enjoying the rest of the sounds.Invert X/Y: Camera controls are now customizable.Camera Shake: Now optional (On/Off).Sensitivity Sliders: Fine-tune your controls.FPS: Range from 30 to 144.Main Menu: Added a new animation to bring the menu to life.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-18T18:29:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329262408","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1836506165570977","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"announcement","title":"NEW FREE DEMO AVALAIBLE!!","summary":"I am pleased to announce that the demo is finally out! 2 rooms to clear, 2 bosses, 2 trap corridors, many minions and, of course, Dracoulous to mock you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T16:20:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4845290-1835871199310899","game_id":"steam-4845290","kind":"announcement","title":"New trailer","summary":"New trailer is out! Come take a look at the fast-paced gameplay!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T13:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199310899","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4845290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:48Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4845290":"2026-10-26T14:50:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4845290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:48Z"},"4892300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:49Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4845290","app_id":4845290,"app_scope":"base","ob